# Tilt watches every path under a custom_build's deps (./backend, ./commerce,
# ...). Local tooling writes into these without changing what ships, and each
# write was rebuilding the image and replacing the pod — which also kills any
# job exec'd into it. `uv run` alone re-installs the project into .venv.
backend/.venv
backend/.ruff_cache
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/.mypy_cache
backend/htmlcov
backend/.coverage
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
